{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>公主有請～這是你的粉紅色麻雀！時尚品牌 LoveShackFancy 驚喜宣佈與人氣麻雀品牌 Oh My Mahjong 攜手合作，整副麻雀以品牌標誌性的粉嫩色調為主軸，每一隻牌面上的圖案均特別採用優雅的水彩畫風重新設計，將古典浪漫與傳統牌局完美結合。推出極夢幻的「粉紅公主風麻雀套裝」！全套組合更隨附專屬的碎花圖案收納包，骰子與配件都滿載夢幻少女心，忍不住想天天叫朋友上屋企打牌！這款套裝將於 10 月 1 日在 LoveShackFancy官網獨家發售！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179087043862352494_2095602456abe83a70e18e.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179087044028727567_16205435396abe83a89d63a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17908704423436064_5605855216abe83ab56596.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179087044501096684_12735212786abe83ae04066.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179087044740929479_19400265746abe83afcd286.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179087044896040697_4073764836abe83b158ab3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179087045037946281_17773645756abe83b2b4e8b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T16:19:08.830124+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}